WEBVTT

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:18.170
I tribute Superheavy Samurai Blue Brawler 
and Superheavy Samurai Swordsman.

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:23.020
I Tribute Summon Superheavy 
Samurai Big Benkei!

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:31.060
Yuya, battle one-on-one 
against the man Gongenzaka!

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:34.750
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:39.600
I activate the Quick-Play 
Spell Hippo Carnival!

00:00:40.170 --> 00:00:42.620
It's showtime!

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:47.820
Are you making fun of me?

00:00:47.820 --> 00:00:50.400
Take this seriously, Yuya!

00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:55.640
What are you doing, Yuzu?

00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:57.200
I'm sorry, Dad.

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:59.910
If this breaks, I can't teach with passion!

00:00:59.910 --> 00:01:02.170
Solid Vision will vanish!

00:01:02.170 --> 00:01:07.150
This is You Show School's 
entertainment dueling!

00:01:19.550 --> 00:01:25.280
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:01:25.280 --> 00:01:33.370
In duels where the field, monsters and duelists 
become one, the people are caught in a frenzy of excitement!

00:01:34.750 --> 00:01:37.370
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:01:53.060 --> 00:01:56.150
You!  The strongest card 
isn't about winning or losing

00:01:56.480 --> 00:01:59.560
You!  At full speed  On the game

00:02:06.620 --> 00:02:08.300
Swinging ma ma ma mind

00:02:08.300 --> 00:02:12.870
The soul's pendulum  Ultimate confusion

00:02:13.370 --> 00:02:15.070
Impulse  Got it got it

00:02:15.070 --> 00:02:20.280
Tough battles  Real revolution

00:02:26.640 --> 00:02:31.090
Everybody goin'  Break through the walls!

00:02:33.260 --> 00:02:37.960
Infinite future  Get rid of indecision!

00:02:38.650 --> 00:02:41.900
Make it Make it  Be courageous (Break it now)

00:02:41.900 --> 00:02:45.300
Step ahead!  Take a step (Do it now)

00:02:45.300 --> 00:02:55.580
The fun is only getting started!  
So everyone's a Believer!!

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:58.920
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:09.760
The Tracks of Light, Pendulum Summon

00:03:33.910 --> 00:03:37.800
I can't teach with passion!

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:43.910
The Solid Vision System broke, and we scared 
away the student who wanted to apply to our school.

00:03:43.910 --> 00:03:46.870
At this rate, You Show 
School will go bankrupt!

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:51.690
Sheesh.  If Yuzu didn't break the 
machine, I could've made him laugh more.

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:53.690
It's your fault because you were goofing off!

00:03:53.690 --> 00:03:55.800
Look at me when you're talking to me!

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:01.800
You're still here, Gongenzaka?

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:04.620
That boy wasn't laughing.

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:09.050
Actually, he was laughing quite a bit.

00:04:09.050 --> 00:04:13.330
Making people laugh and being 
laughed at are totally different!

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:19.220
Your father Yusyo Sakaki made 
everyone smile with his dueling.

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:22.670
Did you forget that those 
smiles came from the heart?

00:04:23.270 --> 00:04:27.050
But in the end, everyone laughed at my dad.

00:04:27.050 --> 00:04:28.420
Yuya!

00:04:30.420 --> 00:04:34.360
Oh my, it looks like there's trouble.

00:04:34.360 --> 00:04:36.990
Umm, who are you?

00:04:36.990 --> 00:04:47.050
I'm Nico Smiley, the current Action Duel 
champion Strong Ishijima's manager and promoter.

00:04:47.500 --> 00:04:49.270
Strong Ishijima!

00:04:52.070 --> 00:04:55.240
Hone your skills at LDS!

00:04:55.240 --> 00:05:00.930
If you seriously want to be a pro, then 
attend Leo Corporation's Leo Duel School!

00:05:00.930 --> 00:05:02.980
I'll be waiting.

00:05:03.220 --> 00:05:11.850
Strong Ishijima is LDS's spokesman, and I'm 
inviting Yuya to attend his fan appreciation day.

00:05:12.190 --> 00:05:15.490
And I'll face Strong Ishijima?

00:05:15.490 --> 00:05:18.130
That's right!  You can battle him!

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:22.130
Your wish from three 
years ago will come true.

00:05:27.990 --> 00:05:30.620
What's going on?

00:05:30.620 --> 00:05:37.530
The current champion Yusyo Sakaki hasn't 
shown up for the Action Duel Championship finals!

00:05:38.070 --> 00:05:40.190
Yusyo, you're scared!

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:42.530
He's afraid to lose, so he ran away!

00:05:42.530 --> 00:05:43.590
Coward!

00:05:43.590 --> 00:05:44.790
Scaredy cat!

00:05:45.020 --> 00:05:46.870
My dad will come!

00:05:46.870 --> 00:05:48.620
Until he does, I'll face you!

00:05:48.620 --> 00:05:49.930
Duel me, Ishijima!

00:05:49.930 --> 00:05:51.530
That's enough, Yuya!

00:05:51.530 --> 00:05:54.220
I will never run away!

00:05:55.600 --> 00:06:00.670
We already have everything prepared.

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:06.440
No!

00:06:06.440 --> 00:06:09.360
I won't allow Yuya to participate.

00:06:09.790 --> 00:06:16.020
Why?  If Yusyo Sakaki's son participates, 
the crowd will be very happy.

00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:18.820
I won't let you disgrace Yuya!

00:06:20.760 --> 00:06:23.760
You don't know how Yuya's been 
feeling these past three years!

00:06:24.460 --> 00:06:26.160
Just leave!

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:28.530
That's too bad.

00:06:28.630 --> 00:06:38.540
If you agreed, we were going to give you Leo 
Corporation's newest Real Solid Vision System as thanks.

00:06:38.680 --> 00:06:40.790
For free.

00:06:40.790 --> 00:06:42.020
Are you serious?

00:06:43.470 --> 00:06:46.650
You just said that you wouldn't 
let them disgrace Yuya!

00:06:46.650 --> 00:06:48.270
But...

00:06:48.270 --> 00:06:49.990
This school is important, but...

00:06:50.930 --> 00:06:53.530
What's important is Yuya's feelings.

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:57.560
He's not here.

00:07:23.320 --> 00:07:25.330
Laugh when you want to cry.

00:07:25.330 --> 00:07:27.700
Laugh with all your might.

00:07:28.070 --> 00:07:31.500
While you're laughing, you'll 
actually become happy.

00:07:31.500 --> 00:07:34.330
That will give you energy.

00:07:37.530 --> 00:07:39.190
It's like a pendulum.

00:07:40.450 --> 00:07:43.360
The bigger it swings, the 
bigger it swings back.

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:44.970
It's the same in a duel.

00:07:44.970 --> 00:07:46.410
A duel?

00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:50.430
If you get scared and cringe, 
you can't do anything.

00:07:50.430 --> 00:07:54.020
If you want to win, then have 
courage and step forward.

00:07:54.360 --> 00:07:58.120
That courage will return as happiness.

00:07:58.670 --> 00:08:00.170
Like a pendulum.

00:08:00.170 --> 00:08:04.130
A pendulum is also a tool for discovery.

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:11.820
If you lose your way, this pendulum will 
point in the direction that you should go.

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:13.530
Swing...

00:08:15.420 --> 00:08:17.130
Swing, pendulum.

00:08:17.820 --> 00:08:21.100
Bigger...  Even bigger...

00:08:32.260 --> 00:08:37.420
It's finally time for today's main event!

00:08:37.420 --> 00:08:46.670
Strong Ishijima's challenger is the 
legendary dueling star Yusyo Sakaki's son, Yuya Sakaki!

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:47.730
Yuya...

00:08:47.730 --> 00:08:50.210
Is he really going to show up?

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:52.590
Hooray!  I'll get the Solid Vis-

00:08:53.850 --> 00:08:59.490
This special match will use 
official Action Duel rules.

00:08:59.490 --> 00:09:03.690
I activate the Field Spell Castle of Chaos!

00:09:14.630 --> 00:09:19.360
Observe!  It's so realistic that it 
can be mistaken for the real thing!

00:09:19.360 --> 00:09:22.790
This is LDS's Solid Vision System!

00:09:24.280 --> 00:09:32.990
Whoa!  Standing at the top of that castle is 
the Action Duel champion for the past three years!

00:09:32.990 --> 00:09:36.190
It's Strong Ishijima!

00:09:38.190 --> 00:09:44.330
Facing this mighty champion is 
the young challenger Yuya Sakaki!

00:09:44.330 --> 00:09:46.420
This is who I was waiting for!

00:09:49.300 --> 00:09:52.140
Yuya, make your entrance!

00:09:52.390 --> 00:09:54.360
Did he run away?

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:57.450
That's just like his dad three years ago.

00:09:57.450 --> 00:09:59.970
Father and son are both cowards!

00:09:59.970 --> 00:10:00.990
Hey!

00:10:00.990 --> 00:10:02.100
Don't, Yuzu.

00:10:02.100 --> 00:10:03.270
But!

00:10:04.360 --> 00:10:09.660
I thought Yusyo Sakaki would show 
up if I got his son involved.

00:10:09.850 --> 00:10:15.030
Dammit!  I can't consider myself the 
strongest champion if I don't beat him!

00:10:15.030 --> 00:10:16.360
What's that?

00:10:16.360 --> 00:10:17.560
A clown?

00:10:21.360 --> 00:10:23.360
Is that clown...

00:10:23.360 --> 00:10:24.670
Champion, behind you!

00:10:24.670 --> 00:10:25.870
What?

00:10:25.870 --> 00:10:27.050
Behind you!

00:10:30.130 --> 00:10:33.300
You're Yusyo Sakaki's brat!

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:37.330
Is this how you behave towards a champion?

00:10:38.180 --> 00:10:40.270
I apologize.

00:10:40.270 --> 00:10:43.250
Then let me start over.

00:10:43.250 --> 00:10:46.090
Will you duel me?

00:10:55.930 --> 00:10:58.760
Let's see what you got, Sir Champion.

00:10:58.760 --> 00:11:00.470
“See what I got?"

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:03.210
You're a punk with no manners!

00:11:03.670 --> 00:11:06.910
I will discipline you with 
my professional skills!

00:11:09.010 --> 00:11:14.730
Whoa!  In a sudden turn of 
events, both duelists are here!

00:11:14.730 --> 00:11:18.060
Draw five cards to your hands!

00:11:18.510 --> 00:11:21.730
The duelists meet at the battlefield!

00:11:21.730 --> 00:11:29.090
Along with their monsters, they'll kick the 
ground and fly through the sky to move around the field!

00:11:29.090 --> 00:11:32.200
Witness dueling's greatest evolution!

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:33.870
Action...

00:11:34.110 --> 00:11:34.960
Duel!

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:48.910
Action Cards are dispersed on 
the field!  Start the battle!

00:11:48.910 --> 00:11:50.690
I'll let you go first.

00:11:50.690 --> 00:11:55.220
Just in case, you're not allowed 
to draw on the first turn.

00:11:56.290 --> 00:11:59.300
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:11:59.800 --> 00:12:05.310
I present you with genuine Action Dueling!

00:12:05.310 --> 00:12:06.240
What?

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:08.690
I'll first bring out...

00:12:08.690 --> 00:12:12.330
I summon Performapal Hip Hippo!

00:12:17.050 --> 00:12:20.510
Try to catch me!

00:12:20.510 --> 00:12:22.820
He's already running away?

00:12:22.820 --> 00:12:26.650
Since he's Yusyo Sakaki's son, 
he runs away really fast.

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:30.510
What are you doing, Yuya?

00:12:30.510 --> 00:12:32.900
He should boldly face him!

00:12:35.370 --> 00:12:37.710
I'll catch you right away.

00:12:37.710 --> 00:12:40.110
My turn!  I draw!

00:12:42.810 --> 00:12:47.310
I activate the spell card 
Feast of the Wild LV5.

00:12:47.310 --> 00:12:53.390
I Special Summon two Level 5 Warrior-Type 
monsters from my hand by negating their effects.

00:12:53.390 --> 00:12:57.000
Appear, Lava Battleguard 
and Swamp Battleguard!

00:12:57.360 --> 00:13:01.580
I tribute these two monsters 
to Tribute Summon!

00:13:02.870 --> 00:13:09.000
From the depths of the dense forest, throw 
down the giant trees and show yourself!

00:13:09.400 --> 00:13:12.650
The barbarian king that 
rules the savage kingdom!

00:13:13.710 --> 00:13:15.530
Battleguard King!

00:13:15.930 --> 00:13:22.020
There it is!  Ishijima's 
ace monster has arrived!

00:13:22.850 --> 00:13:26.730
Your dad may have escaped me, 
but I won't let you escape!

00:13:26.730 --> 00:13:27.930
Let's battle!

00:13:27.930 --> 00:13:31.800
Battleguard King, attack Hip Hippo!

00:13:31.800 --> 00:13:34.490
How lucky!  I got an Action Card!

00:13:34.690 --> 00:13:36.780
The Action Spell Evasion!

00:13:36.780 --> 00:13:38.420
Rolling Hippo!

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:41.450
He can't win if he only runs away.

00:13:41.450 --> 00:13:42.820
Why won't he battle properly?

00:13:42.820 --> 00:13:45.400
He is battling properly.

00:13:46.330 --> 00:13:47.740
Yoko!

00:13:48.250 --> 00:13:52.750
Yuma is trying to reinvent 
himself through battle.

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:57.710
You've mastered Action Cards?

00:13:57.710 --> 00:14:00.590
I expect nothing less 
from Yusyo Sakaki's son.

00:14:00.590 --> 00:14:03.130
But a pro goes beyond that!

00:14:03.130 --> 00:14:11.530
Since I tributed Battleguards to Tribute Summon 
Battleguard King, it can attack twice in one turn!

00:14:11.530 --> 00:14:13.430
What?  A second attack?

00:14:15.980 --> 00:14:17.450
He did it!

00:14:17.450 --> 00:14:23.180
With 3000 attack points, Battleguard 
King annihilated Hip Hippo... or not!

00:14:23.180 --> 00:14:24.470
What?

00:14:24.780 --> 00:14:26.330
I did it just in time!

00:14:26.330 --> 00:14:29.130
I activated the Action Spell Miracle!

00:14:29.130 --> 00:14:34.560
Its effect negated my monster's destruction 
and cut the battle damage in half!

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:36.330
He's incredible!

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:38.390
He's fighting well against the champion!

00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:44.130
Fine.  I set one card and end my turn.

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:47.310
Yuya is trying to reinvent himself?

00:14:47.310 --> 00:14:48.690
What do you mean?

00:14:48.690 --> 00:14:53.360
During these three years, Yuya was 
hiding behind the mask of a clown.

00:14:53.980 --> 00:15:00.560
Before he could get laughed at for having a 
cowardly father, he laughed at himself first.

00:15:01.890 --> 00:15:06.290
But who Yuya really wants 
to be is Yusyo Sakaki.

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:11.760
The legendary dueling star 
who he adored as a child.

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:14.560
The fun is only getting started!

00:15:15.460 --> 00:15:18.420
My turn!  I draw!

00:15:18.660 --> 00:15:19.570
It's here!

00:15:22.200 --> 00:15:26.010
Everyone, it's time for the climax!

00:15:26.250 --> 00:15:32.160
When Tribute Summoning, Performapal 
Hip Hippo counts as two monsters.

00:15:33.090 --> 00:15:37.670
I tribute Hip Hippo to Tribute Summon!

00:15:38.920 --> 00:15:41.710
Please welcome our guest with your applause!

00:15:42.490 --> 00:15:44.290
Today's leading actor!

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:47.310
The rare dragon with two 
different-colored eyes!

00:15:47.310 --> 00:15:49.180
Odd-Eyes Dragon!

00:15:52.800 --> 00:15:55.310
The fun is only getting started!

00:15:56.240 --> 00:15:59.710
Oh yeah!  Yusyo's catchphrase!

00:15:59.710 --> 00:16:01.800
I'm getting fired up!

00:16:01.800 --> 00:16:04.690
You've been waiting for this moment forever.

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:08.020
Stop saying the same catchphrase 
as your cowardly father!

00:16:08.020 --> 00:16:09.850
My dad isn't a coward!

00:16:09.850 --> 00:16:10.650
What?

00:16:11.050 --> 00:16:14.160
I'll defeat you using the 
duel that my dad taught me!

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:17.890
I'll prove that my dad 
is stronger than anyone!

00:16:17.890 --> 00:16:22.600
Your dragon only has 2500 attack points.

00:16:22.600 --> 00:16:25.260
Battleguard King has 3000 
attack points!  It can't win!

00:16:25.900 --> 00:16:28.130
Are you sure about that?

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:31.400
The Continuous Spell Wonder Balloons!

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:38.730
Yuya is getting Action Cards one after 
another and sending them to the graveyard!

00:16:39.180 --> 00:16:41.760
Fly, Wonder Balloons!

00:16:43.760 --> 00:16:48.850
Wonder Balloons gains a balloon for every 
card in my hand that I send to the graveyard.

00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:54.170
Next, the balloons pop by sending 
this card to the graveyard.

00:16:54.170 --> 00:16:58.900
Your monster loses 1000 attack points for 
each balloon until the end of the turn.

00:17:02.070 --> 00:17:04.160
Three balloons popped!

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:08.020
That means Battleguard 
King has 0 attack points!

00:17:08.020 --> 00:17:13.010
Incredible!  I've never seen anyone 
use Action Cards like this!

00:17:13.310 --> 00:17:16.820
You can only have one 
Action Card in your hand.

00:17:16.820 --> 00:17:22.760
He pretended to run away, but he was 
actually finding the locations of the Action Cards.

00:17:23.620 --> 00:17:26.490
I've always been an expert at finding things.

00:17:26.730 --> 00:17:28.110
Incredible!

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:29.600
He's pressuring the champion!

00:17:35.180 --> 00:17:36.560
This applause!

00:17:36.560 --> 00:17:38.160
These cheers!

00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:41.620
They used to applaud my dad the same way!

00:17:42.960 --> 00:17:44.600
Let's go, Odd-Eyes!

00:17:44.600 --> 00:17:47.780
We have to get this crowd even more excited!

00:17:47.780 --> 00:17:55.090
When Odd-Eyes Dragon destroys a Level 5-or-above 
monster, you take damage equal to half its original attack points!

00:17:56.070 --> 00:18:00.780
Half of Battleguard King's 
original attack points is 1500.

00:18:00.780 --> 00:18:05.560
Combined with 2500 points of battle 
damage, that's 4000 points of damage!

00:18:06.020 --> 00:18:08.200
It'll be a one shot kill!

00:18:08.200 --> 00:18:12.690
Battle, Odd-Eyes Dragon!  
Attack Battleguard King!

00:18:12.690 --> 00:18:14.570
Spiral Flame!

00:18:18.480 --> 00:18:20.380
It burned up!  He won!

00:18:20.380 --> 00:18:21.490
Yuya!

00:18:32.380 --> 00:18:33.530
Why?

00:18:37.500 --> 00:18:41.130
I also activated an Action Spell.

00:18:41.130 --> 00:18:43.980
The same Miracle that you used.

00:18:43.980 --> 00:18:46.020
That's why he's the champion!

00:18:46.020 --> 00:18:48.820
He doesn't make blunders, 
so he had an Action Card!

00:18:48.820 --> 00:18:52.600
Yusyo Sakaki's dueling techniques 
are nothing special!

00:18:52.600 --> 00:18:55.930
I activate the Continuous 
Trap Battleguard Rage!

00:18:55.930 --> 00:19:02.160
When I take battle damage, one 
Battleguard gains 2000 attack points.

00:19:03.050 --> 00:19:04.320
I end my turn!

00:19:04.320 --> 00:19:10.800
Wonder Balloons's effect is over at the end 
of the turn, so it gains its attack points back!

00:19:10.800 --> 00:19:13.770
It's more powered up than before!

00:19:14.330 --> 00:19:19.270
I'll give you your last rites.  My turn!

00:19:20.330 --> 00:19:22.600
I won't let you escape!  Let's battle!

00:19:22.600 --> 00:19:26.330
Battleguard King, attack Odd-Eyes Dragon!

00:19:36.730 --> 00:19:42.600
Due to Battleguard Rage's effect, your Dragon 
returns to your hand instead of to the graveyard.

00:19:43.060 --> 00:19:47.270
I activate the Quick-Play 
Spell Battleguard Magic.

00:19:47.270 --> 00:19:53.040
I regain life points equal to half the attack 
points of Odd-Eyes Dragon that returned to your hand!

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:54.870
He has 4000 life points!

00:19:55.890 --> 00:20:00.420
Battleguard King can only 
attack monsters twice.

00:20:00.420 --> 00:20:02.010
You're lucky to survive.

00:20:02.730 --> 00:20:05.890
I set one card and end my turn.

00:20:05.890 --> 00:20:08.990
It's your turn.  Draw.

00:20:09.180 --> 00:20:11.620
Or will you surrender?

00:20:11.620 --> 00:20:13.990
Will you run away like your dad?

00:20:13.990 --> 00:20:18.060
No!  I won't ru-

00:20:18.380 --> 00:20:23.800
But I only have monster cards 
in my hand.  What can I do?

00:20:24.560 --> 00:20:25.850
Yuya...

00:20:30.110 --> 00:20:35.310
It was impossible to take my dad's place...

00:20:36.110 --> 00:20:38.380
Laugh when you want to cry.

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:42.160
The bigger it swings, the 
bigger it swings back.

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:46.330
If you get scared and cringe, 
you can't do anything.

00:20:46.330 --> 00:20:51.130
If you want to win, then have 
courage and step forward!

00:20:52.130 --> 00:20:57.050
Swing, pendulum!  Bigger!  Even bigger!

00:21:10.600 --> 00:21:18.560
I set the Pendulum Scale with Scale 1 
Stargazer Magician and Scale 8 Timegazer Magician!

00:21:32.730 --> 00:21:37.090
Now I can summon monsters between 
Level 2 and 7 simultaneously!

00:21:37.090 --> 00:21:38.740
What's happening?

00:21:38.740 --> 00:21:41.710
Swing, my soul's pendulum!

00:21:41.710 --> 00:21:44.680
Draw an arc of light in the sky!

00:21:44.680 --> 00:21:46.470
Pendulum Summon!

00:21:46.470 --> 00:21:50.110
Come out, my monsters!

00:22:01.130 --> 00:22:02.420
What...

00:22:02.420 --> 00:22:03.800
...is this?

00:22:14.260 --> 00:22:19.770
Catch the dream dancing in my heart
Release my falling tears

00:22:19.960 --> 00:22:29.220
I'll step out on to my first field
To meet my miracle  Fabulous One Step

00:22:36.110 --> 00:22:41.230
I realized that strength can't be given

00:22:41.490 --> 00:22:46.470
It's something I have to grab myself

00:22:46.760 --> 00:22:51.910
In that case, I have to keep moving
I can't stay still

00:22:52.160 --> 00:22:57.170
Even if walls and headwinds block my way

00:22:57.370 --> 00:23:02.770
I'll draw my trump card called 
"courage" to take a step forward

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:07.190
I believe in my story of victory

00:23:07.480 --> 00:23:13.190
Everyone during battle is My Way
Duelists are being tested

00:23:13.190 --> 00:23:18.570
When times are tough, that's when you 
Smile, Jump, Fight & Step Up!

00:23:18.570 --> 00:23:23.900
Your smile is your Energy
Kick away your feelings of running away

00:23:23.900 --> 00:23:33.240
Jump into the new field
Shiny One Step that leads to the future

00:23:34.240 --> 00:23:41.460
One step... Just one step is fine
That's your Big Chance!!

00:23:45.930 --> 00:23:50.740
When the tracks of light were drawn into the 
sky, it was the start of a new era of dueling!

00:23:50.960 --> 00:23:54.570
Everyone, look at my new power!

00:23:54.570 --> 00:23:56.500
This is Pendulum Summon!

00:23:56.500 --> 00:23:59.620
Come out, my monsters!

00:23:59.620 --> 00:24:01.420
What's that monster?

00:24:01.420 --> 00:24:05.320
Burn everything you see with 
your different-colored eyes!

00:24:05.320 --> 00:24:11.730
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
Dueling's Greatest Evolution!!
Its Name is Action Duel

00:24:11.730 --> 00:24:14.250
The fun is only getting started!
